sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dispatcher as Flight Dispatcher (OCC)
    actor Captain as Pilot-in-Command
    participant Nav as FMS & Navigation Database
    participant Wx as MET Office (METAR/TAF)
    participant Slot as Eurocontrol NM (ATFM)

    Dispatcher->>Wx: Retrieve Enroute Winds & Terminal Minima
    Wx-->>Dispatcher: TAF/SIGMET/Upper Air Temps
    Dispatcher->>Nav: Calculate Optimal Trajectory & Cost Index
    Nav-->>Dispatcher: Computed Flight Plan & Fuel Requirement
    Dispatcher->>Slot: File ICAO Flight Plan & Request CTOT
    Slot-->>Dispatcher: Acknowledged / Slot Allocated
    Dispatcher->>Captain: Briefing Package (OFP, Mass & Balance, NOTAMs)
    Captain->>Dispatcher: Review, Validate Fuel & Joint Operational Release
